2025-11-08 03:04:55,403 | INFO | ai-engine.app | Received scoring request: {'expectedMeaning': 'User wants a step-by-step guide to obtain UAE Pass, including app download, registration, identity verification, and activation.', 'actualResponse': 'Step-by-Step Guide: How to Get a UAE Pass  The UAE Pass is the official national digital identity for citizens, residents, and visitors in the United Arab Emirates. It allows secure access to thousands of government, semi-government, and private sector services online, and enables digital document signing without visiting service centers12.  Step 1: Download the UAE Pass App   Download the official UAE Pass app from the Apple App Store (iOS) or Google Play Store (Android)13.  Alternatively, visit the UAE Pass website to find download links or scan the QR code provided there1.  Step 2: Start the Registration Process   Open the UAE Pass app on your device.  On the initial screen, tap the “Sign Up” button to begin creating your account1.  Step 3: Enter Your Details   Register using your Emirates ID (for residents and citizens) or passport (for eligible visitors)2.  Fill in the required personal information as prompted by the app.  Step 4: Verify Your Identity   The app will guide you through a biometric face recognition (facial ID) process to verify your identity23.  This step is secure and typically takes less than 5 minutes.  No need to visit a government service center for verification, thanks to advanced facial recognition technology23.  Step 5: Set Up Your Account   Create a secure PIN and set up any additional security features as instructed.  You may be asked to allow certain permissions for the app to function properly.  Step 6: Complete Registration   Once your identity is verified and your account is set up, you will have a fully functional UAE Pass.  You can now use your UAE Pass to log in to government and private sector services, sign documents digitally, and access your digital vault for official documents23.  Additional Support   For assistance, you can contact the UAE Pass help desk at 600 561 111, available 24/723.  Key Benefits of UAE Pass   Single digital identity for accessing over 6,000 services across the UAE.  Secure digital document signing.  No need for paper documents or in-person verification.  Available for citizens, residents, and eligible visitors23.  References  1: UAE Pass Official Signup Guide – Step-by-Step Instructions \n2: Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs & Port Security – UAE Pass Overview \n3: UAE Government Portal – About the UAE Pass App     Sources  Ask  Explain    ', 'keywords': [], 'benchmark': 0.3}
