2025-11-08 03:15:51,923 | INFO | ai-engine.app | Received scoring request: {'expectedMeaning': 'User wants a step-by-step guide to obtain UAE Pass, including app download, registration, identity verification, and activation.', 'actualResponse': 'Step-by-Step Guide: How to Get a UAE Pass  The UAE Pass is the official national digital identity for citizens, residents, and visitors in the United Arab Emirates. It allows you to securely access thousands of government, semi-government, and private sector services online, as well as digitally sign documents12. Here’s how you can register for a UAE Pass:  1. Download the UAE Pass App   Go to the App Store (iOS) or Google Play Store (Android).  Search for “UAE Pass” and download the official app.  Alternatively, you can visit the UAE Pass website (https://uaepass.ae/signup ) or scan the QR code provided there to download the app directly13.  2. Start the Registration Process   Open the UAE Pass app on your device.  On the initial screen, tap the “Sign Up” button to begin creating your new account1.  3. Enter Your Details   Register using your Emirates ID (for residents and citizens) or passport (for visitors, if eligible).  Fill in the required personal information as prompted by the app2.  4. Verify Your Identity   The app will use biometric face recognition (facial ID) to verify your identity.  Follow the on-screen instructions to scan your face. This process is secure and typically takes less than 5 minutes23.  Previously, users had to visit a government service center for verification, but now the process is fully digital for most users3.  5. Set Up Your Account   Create a secure PIN and/or enable biometric authentication (such as fingerprint or Face ID) for future logins.  Review and accept the terms and conditions.  6. Complete Registration   Once your identity is verified and your account is set up, you can start using your UAE Pass immediately.  You will now have a single digital identity to access over 6,000 services across government and private sectors23.  Additional Features   Digitally sign documents and share them securely.  Store and access digital versions of your official documents in the app’s digital vault.  Update your profile and address records as needed3.  Support   For assistance, you can contact the UAE Pass help desk at 600 561 111, available 24/723.  References  1: UAE Pass Official Signup Page – Step-by-Step Registration \n2: Federal Authority for Identity, Citizenship, Customs & Port Security – UAE Pass Overview \n3: UAE Government Portal – UAE Pass App Features and Benefits     Sources  Ask  Explain', 'keywords': [], 'benchmark': 0.3}
